      },
      {
        "native_id": "1pyg66cf0l19",
        "status": "investigating",
        "body": "Copilot is experiencing a higher rate of errors for OpenAI models, including gpt-5.2, gpt-5.3-codex, gpt-5.4, gpt-5.4, and the gpt-5.6 family of models. Other models are not impacted. \u003cbr /\u003e",
        "created_at": "2026-08-31T09:22:18.98Z"
      },
      {
        "native_id": "q57vxd9pzl14",
        "status": "investigating",
        "body": "One of our model providers has confirmed an incident on their end. We have provided them details to help identify the issue. We are starting to see recovery.",
        "created_at": "2026-08-31T09:48:12.092Z"
      },
      {
        "native_id": "lljqyldh2ylz",
        "status": "monitoring",
        "body": "The degradation affecting Copilot AI Model Providers has been mitigated. We are monitoring to ensure stability.",
        "created_at": "2026-08-31T09:51:13.994Z"
      },
      {
        "native_id": "m3lsjd62jrrs",
        "status": "monitoring",
        "body": "The issues with our upstream model provider have been resolved, and gpt-5.3-codex, gpt-5.4-mini, gpt-5.4-nano, gpt-5.5, and the gpt-5.6 family of models are once again available in Copilot products and IDE surfaces.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eWe will continue monitoring to ensure stability, but mitigation is complete.",
        "created_at": "2026-08-31T09:58:02.165Z"
      },
      {
